comments.body:
@wtfsayo  yeap, it was pretty stratighforward, actually. Just follow this 2 simple steps:

**1)** Be sure to use the latest code on main index.ts. Verify that your startAgents function ends with the following if statement:

  const isDaemonProcess = process.env.DAEMON_PROCESS === "true";
  if(!isDaemonProcess) {
    elizaLogger.log("Chat started. Type 'exit' to quit.");
    const chat = startChat(characters);
    chat();
  }

Note: This code tests if you are running terminal or a Daemon Process (linux service), and fires chat in case of terminal.

**2)** Go to your main .env file and find the key:

DAEMON_PROCESS=false

If it's set to "false", you must change it to "true".

Hope that helps!

